flowchart LR
    ORG[Organization]
    PAT[Patient]
    CLI[Clinical]
    LAB[Lab]
    PHA[Pharmacy]
    BIL[Billing]
    NOTI[Notification]
    REP[Report]
    OPS[Operations]
    MQ[(RabbitMQ<br/>mediflow.events)]
    DLQ[(DLX / DLQ)]

    ORG -->|staff.department.changed| MQ
    PAT -->|patient.created| MQ
    CLI -->|appointment.created<br/>medicalrecord.created| MQ
    LAB -->|lab.result.created| MQ
    PHA -->|prescription.created<br/>prescription.filled<br/>stock.low| MQ
    BIL -->|invoice.created<br/>payment.completed<br/>payment.failed| MQ
    NOTI -->|notification.sent| MQ

    MQ -->|patient, appointment,<br/>lab, payment, dispense| NOTI
    MQ -->|clinical, lab,<br/>pharmacy, billing events| REP
    MQ -->|medicalrecord.created<br/>payment.completed| LAB
    MQ -->|payment.completed| PHA
    MQ -->|prescription.created<br/>dispense result| BIL
    MQ -->|lab.result.created<br/>prescription.filled| CLI
    MQ -->|stock.low| OPS
    MQ -.->|retry vượt giới hạn| DLQ
